<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Asally et al. (2012) PNAS & Yan et al. (2019) Nature Physics osmotic matrix swelling, localized cell-death delamination, and Föppl–von Kármán radial wrinkle spokes in Bacillus subtilis biofilms (Bacillus subtilis (NCIB 3610 wild-type and matrix/cell-death mutant biofilm macrocolonies))",
        "Asally et al. (2012) PNAS & Yan et al. (2019) Nature Physics osmotic matrix swelling, localized cell-death delamination, and Föppl–von Kármán radial wrinkle spokes in Bacillus subtilis biofilms faithfully reproduces Bacillus subtilis (NCIB 3610 wild-type and matrix/cell-death mutant biofilm macrocolonies) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2013-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Bacillus subtilis (NCIB 3610 wild-type and matrix/cell-death mutant biofilm macrocolonies) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 93.6/100, audit 2026-10-19-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2013-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling.py> ;
    schema:about "Bacillus subtilis (NCIB 3610 wild-type and matrix/cell-death mutant biofilm macrocolonies)" ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/2013-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling.py; output: docs/media/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling_comparison.png; organism: Bacillus subtilis (NCIB 3610 wild-type and matrix/cell-death mutant biofilm macrocolonies); checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 80d4742b3055639fafb02a0909f223313e723e53cf52d4df159742cd92171fba; artifact_sha256: 68b793a887248a1043ff93072882c4552ea9070e6af8a2036074f6a15acf9574; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/bacillus_biofilm_specimen.jpg=0ab531dfc2ded692..., datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling_reference.json=7d866d4d5136d397..., datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/paper_citations.bib=ae278450d6851340..., datasets/bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling/scout_manifest.json=d546628168a39289...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-audit" ;
