<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Asally et al. (2012) PNAS & Yan et al. (2019) Nature Physics osmotic matrix swelling, localized cell-death delamination, and Föppl–von Kármán radial wrinkle spokes in Bacillus subtilis biofilms — Model fidelity to source: 95/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements plane-strain Föppl–von Kármán bilayer buckling mechanics (`compute_fvk_wavelength_and_strain`, L91-147), spatiotemporal basal cell-death patterning (`build_cell_death_template`, L153-175), and a 2D pseudo-spectral + L-BFGS-B energy minimizer (`relax_fvk_biofilm_colony`, L178-297) with genetic and artificial score controls (`evaluate_genetic_and_mechanical_controls`, L393-425), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_094_bacillus_biofilm_wrinkling.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.5e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Asally et al. (2012) PNAS & Yan et al. (2019) Nature Physics osmotic matrix swelling, localized cell-death delamination, and Föppl–von Kármán radial wrinkle spokes in Bacillus subtilis biofilms — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L511-606) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: agar stiffness wavelength Pearson r = 1.0000 (p = 3.74e-12, RMSE = 1.94 um), log-log agar stiffness exponent |alpha_E| = 0.3338 ± 0.0008 (ref 0.3333), thickness wavelength Pearson r = 1.0000 (p = 4.57e-11, slope = 0.9999 ± 0.0017), relaxed FvK standard-agar wavelength 773.32 um (ref 750.0 um), WT spoke count 13 (ref 13), Delta eps/tasA mutant amplitude 0.0 um (ref 0.0 um), guided m=6 score spoke count 6 (ref 6), specimen focal spoke count 12 (ref 13), and specimen mean spoke angle 30.0 deg (ref 27.69 deg)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-agar-stiffness-sweep-0-5-10-kpa-wrinkle-wavelength-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-artificial-cell-death-mechanical-score-pattern-m-6-guided-spoke-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-biofilm-thickness-scaling-40-140-um-wavelength-correlation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-log-log-agar-stiffness-wavelength-scaling-exponent-alpha-e-lambda-c-e-s-alpha-e>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-matrix-deficient-mutant-delta-epsa-o-delta-tasa-wrinkle-amplitude>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-specimen-focal-b-subtilis-macrocolony-radial-wrinkle-spoke-count>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-specimen-focal-macrocolony-mean-angular-spoke-spacing>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-asally-bacillus-biofilm-wrinkling-measurement-standard-1-5-agar-e-s-2-5-kpa-relaxed-fvk-wrinkle-wavelength>,
